# Defective AI-generated project covers: these embed claims that are not true
# (a "HIPAA Compliant" badge, an AWS S3 chip where the project uses Supabase,
# a PostgreSQL layer the translator does not use) plus garbled text. The UI
# renders ProjectCover instead. Real screenshots may be added under
# public/images/ later; only these specific sets are excluded.
/public/images/medi/
/public/images/support/
/public/images/transl/
/public/images/baby/
/public/images/bistro/
/public/images/devdoc/
